h of a second, using millions of tiny colour sacs in its skin called chromatophores — and it does it while being colour-blind. Add a third colour and shorten the waits to see how fast you can make it flicker.","accent":"#b4552a"}},{"id":"68317803-3d59-4746-9d28-54b0ad7bce5c","createdAt":1786894183225,"transform":{"position":[-5,2.2000000000000064,-29],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f5f5f5"}]}